	'k4ebe62ec' => 'Yes, we encourage clients to borrow sample corners to evaluate mouldings within their actual domestic lighting. You may borrow up to six timber corner chevrons for seven days completely free of charge. Take them home and hold them against your wall at different times of day to see how natural morning sun and evening lamps affect the wood tone.',
	'k4ed6e448' => 'Book a fitting',
