	'kb4f5ffa7' => 'Medium frame',
	'kb5d809e0' => '/ And questions',
	'kb6ec7abe' => 'Process',
	'kb7568a4d' => '8 mm',
	'kb8ddfbdb' => 'Our street-level framing workshop is located at 27 Cooper\'s Yard in Halden. Visit our counter during public hours or contact our bench team directly.',
	'kba697a89' => 'Ask at the counter · subject to bench space',
	'kbb085436' => 'Bench notes',
	'kbb7299fd' => 'Tue–Sat 10:00–18:00, Thursday until 20:00',
	'kbbc0c98f' => '/ To the wall',
	'kbcc254b5' => 'Phone',
	'kbe435a92' => 'Standard turnaround for custom framing is ten working days from the moment your fitting is confirmed at the bench. When an urgent deadline requires immediate attention, our express service completes your frame in three working days for an additional forty dollars.',
	'kbe62ee40' => 'By appointment',
	'kbebd3801' => 'Ash',
	'kbfc87659' => 'Conservation board in stock',
	'kbfed6280' => '30 mm',
	'kc03700e1' => 'Your Rights and Workshop Inquiries',
	'kc2ae81f0' => 'Can I bring an existing frame to be re-fitted or repaired?',
	'kc36f689e' => 'Standard work takes 10 working days.',
	'kc5f29bb3' => 'Privacy',
	'kc6d2a587' => 'All six woods are milled into four clean profiles designed to support prints from eight to forty millimetres in face width. Our flat twenty millimetre profile is our most versatile moulding, sitting square to the wall for modern prints and drawings. The scoop thirty millimetre profile curves gently inward, drawing ambient room light across the frame toward the artwork.',
	'kc79d357e' => 'Yes, we frequently re-fit and repair existing frames brought to our workshop. Priya Nair examines the condition of the timber corners, backing, and glass to determine necessary conservation steps. We can replace old acidic mounts with fresh conservation board cut to a clean forty-five degree bevel, upgrade regular float glass to UV-filtering museum glass for sixty-five dollars, or rebuild loose mitre joints.',
	'kc938867e' => 'Every bevel cut by hand along a steel rule',
	'kc95ed58f' => 'Slip',
	'kc989a5c0' => 'We resolve all inquiries promptly and transparently.',
	'kca9fc08c' => 'We frame for the wall,<br>not for the counter.',
	'kcba0fcc7' => 'Choosing timber directly against your room wall ensures that the finished piece settles naturally into its intended domestic environment.',
	'kcd6a1646' => '[ → ] Ask at the counter',
	'kce8ae9da' => 'Email',
	'kcf51e677' => 'Express in 3 working days (+$40)',
	'kcf6ecf43' => 'Front counter and fittings',
	'kd0f25115' => 'Profiles',
	'kd1891601' => 'We do not share your contact details with external third parties or use tracking marketing cookies. Your email is stored securely and used solely to deliver our monthly letter from the bench, keeping you connected to the craft and people of Gaku Frames.',
	'kd2b605d7' => 'Tomas Reyes',
	'kd34970f7' => 'What is your cancellation or order change policy?',
	'kd38725da' => 'Standard Frame Sizes and Inclusions',
	'kd433decb' => 'Finding Cooper\'s Yard and Parking',
	'kd59b2d73' => 'For masonry and brick, we drill neat pilot holes and set flush mechanical anchors. For plaster and stud walls, we locate structural studs or distribute load across heavy-duty hollow-wall fixings.',
	'kd7d31231' => 'Acid-free board, hand-cut bevel, hinged print',
	'kd9eacdff' => 'Frame prices include a standard mount, float glass and fitting. Walnut and gilt mouldings add 20%. Turnaround is 10 working days; express is 3 working days for +$40.',
	'kdaab4600' => 'Bring the print. Measure the wall.',
	'kdb6c5457' => 'We do not leave finished frames on your doorstep. Eli Brandt delivers directly to your room and installs your frames securely on your wall.',
	'kdc1a968c' => 'A print looks different laid flat on a counter than it does at eye level in a hallway. So before we choose a moulding we ask for a photograph of the wall and its measurements: the ceiling height, the paint, the way the window light falls across it.',
	'kdd0a53c5' => 'Privacy · plain words',
	'kdd7bf230' => 'Address',
	'kdd8e9f58' => '[ → ] Price list',
	'kdd947f1a' => 'If you have questions regarding bespoke dimensions, conservation mounting for fragile media, or delivery rounds, write to bench@gakuframes.example. While we can provide approximate estimates based on dimensions and timber preferences via email, we recommend visiting the shop in person with your artwork.',
	'kddfb7be9' => 'We carry it in, check the wall and hang it level',
	'kde36ead3' => 'Within 25 km, up to 3 frames',
	'kdeabe7ac' => 'How should I clean the frame and glazing?',
	'kdf5caaf4' => '/ Sample corners',
	'ke06592fd' => 'Our craftspeople cut, join, mount, and glaze your frame at the workshop bench over our standard ten working days turnaround.',
	'ke16dd6e1' => 'Prices',
	'ke1d00061' => 'The shop',
	'ke1d5cdb1' => 'Gaku Frames opened in 2011 at 27 Cooper\'s Yard in Halden. We believe a picture is finished by its frame, and we fit the frame to the wall it will hang on.',
	'ke25e7e7f' => 'Dust mouldings lightly with a soft, dry microfibre cloth, avoiding commercial aerosol polishes or wet sponges entirely.',
	'ke3071c31' => '/ Included',
	'ke3168366' => 'Each newsletter announces upcoming hanging round schedules across Halden for Tuesdays and Fridays, helping you coordinate professional home installation by Eli Brandt. We also share advance notice of seasonal workshop hours, bench maintenance schedules, and practical advice on caring for conservation glass and timber mouldings at home. We never send promotional advertising, sales discounts, or repetitive bulletins.',
	'ke3212dd1' => 'We ask to see photos of your room, noting wall paint colours, ceiling heights, and nearby window exposures. Lucía and Mira help you test wood profiles against your print, ensuring the final piece complements your domestic wall rather than fighting it.',
	'ke357582b' => 'Choose at the counter',
	'ke3dec633' => '/ In stock',
	'ke5085685' => 'Contact Lucía Moreno at +1 555 0127 2011 immediately if you need to adjust order details.',
	'ke51d7e07' => 'The team',
	'ke5827188' => 'If you have traditional timber picture rails, hang frames from two brass moulding hooks rather than a single point to distribute weight evenly. Alternatively, book Eli Brandt for our forty-five dollar delivery and hanging service covering up to three frames within twenty-five kilometres.',
	'ke5d4b73c' => '/ By size',
	'ke63f623b' => 'Black-stained ash',
	'ke7f713cc' => 'Scoop',
	'ke89d1659' => '/ Cooper\'s Yard',
	'kea71d9cc' => 'Acrylic provides safety and reduced weight without sacrificing optical flatness or clarity.',
	'kea89281d' => 'Runs the thirty-minute fittings at the counter.',
	'keaab7327' => 'Upgrades and Workshop Options',
	'keacf5c5a' => 'We use your contact details solely to manage your framing project, provide order progress updates over our ten working days turnaround, and coordinate delivery and hanging rounds with Eli Brandt. If you subscribe to Bench notes, your email is used exclusively to send our once-a-month workshop letter. We never sell, rent, trade, or distribute your personal information to third-party marketing agencies or commercial databases.',
	'keaf4a30b' => 'Hand-cuts the bevel in every conservation mount.',
	'kebba51a5' => 'Thursday until 20:00',
	'ked33cd2b' => 'You have the right to inspect, correct, or delete any personal contact details held in our workshop records at any time. If you wish to unsubscribe from Bench notes, you may do so instantly via the unsubscribe link in any email or by writing directly to our workshop team. For questions regarding our privacy practices or to request data removal, please contact Mira Haldane by email at bench@gakuframes.example or by telephone at +1 555 0127 2011.',
	'kedadf03e' => 'Delivery and hanging costs forty-five dollars within twenty-five kilometres of our workshop at 27 Cooper\'s Yard, covering up to three frames per visit. We run dedicated hanging rounds every Tuesday and Friday throughout Halden and surrounding neighbourhoods.',
	'kf00cd375' => 'A 50 × 70 cm print, walnut, museum glass',
	'kf0d4bd4a' => 'Hanging Rounds and Workshop News',
	'kf11280a0' => 'Mira Haldane established Gaku Frames in 2011 with a single workbench, six timber mouldings, and a simple premise: picture framing must consider the room as carefully as the artwork. Operating from our street-level workshop in Cooper\'s Yard, the working bench remains directly visible from the customer counter.',
	'kf1cf81ac' => 'From the saw to the hanging round.',
	'kf2b6dcdc' => 'Oak',
	'kf30741fe' => 'Up to 100 × 140 cm, two-person fitting',
	'kf3fc89fc' => '/ Since 2011',
	'kf5ebc714' => 'We do not process online credit card transactions through our website, and we never collect financial payment credentials or sensitive personal data through automated tracking cookies.',
	'kf9888988' => 'A large frame up to seventy by one hundred centimetres is two hundred and sixty dollars. Our oversize frame up to one hundred by one hundred and forty centimetres costs four hundred and twenty dollars and includes specialized two-person bench fitting.',
	'kfa6b866d' => '[ → ] Visit the shop',
	'kfabb9b9a' => 'We keep six timber mouldings in the workshop rack: natural oak, walnut, ash, maple, black-stained ash, and hand-applied gilt leaf with a warm brass tone. Oak, ash, maple, and black-stained ash are priced at our standard table rates, while walnut and gilt mouldings carry a twenty percent surcharge due to the timber preparation and leaf application. Oak and ash offer clear, open grain that suits casual rooms and monochrome photography.',
	'kfac70b9e' => 'Do you handle oversize artwork?',
	'kfbeae63d' => '3 frames',
	'kfc6df742' => 'Mouldings',
	'kfca380f1' => '/ +$65 per frame',
	'kfce8ddba' => 'Cuts the 45° mitres and joins the timber corners.',
	'kfcebe560' => 'In stock',
	'kfd0cfa65' => '/ Measure the wall',
	'kfdc3ae43' => 'You can tailor your specification with standard workshop upgrades. Walnut and gilt mouldings incur a twenty percent surcharge on the base frame price to account for milling density and leaf finishing.',
	'kfff3ccf7' => 'Avoid abrasive sponges, chemical solvents, or furniture waxes, which damage wood patina and degrade delicate hand-applied gilt finishes.',
